          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A doŋ Paulo onwoŋo tye apido amannono, Fesito te redo i dwon aloŋo ni, “Lo-ni Paulo yin apoa. Pwonyereni atek ateka omio aloki oko idoko apoa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo te gamo doge ni, “Adwoŋ won kwogo Fesito, an gira mom apo. An akobo kop me ateni dok daŋ me ryeko a tere tye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaka gire ŋeo kop magi; i nyime an atwero kop i tekcuny, pien aŋeo aber ni en mom kwia kopporo i kom kop magi, pien gin-ni luŋmom tye moro iye ame otimere i muŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaka Aguripa, yin iye odwarpiny? An aŋeo ni iyegi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aguripa te kobbi Paulo ni, “Itamo ni itwero loka adoko Akricitayo pi kare anonokkoro-ni?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo te gamo ni, “Kadi pi kare anonokkoro onyo abor, akwao Obaŋa ni kono mom yin keken ibedo calo an, ento anaka jo luŋ ame tye awinya tin, cite mom i jegere-ni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaka te ya oko malo gin i aloc kede Berenike, kede jo a rik obedo kedgi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ame gin doŋ owoto oko ote kop kengi kengi ni, “Lonnono gire mom otimo ginnoro a mio oromo neke kadi tweye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aguripa te kobbi Fesito ni, “Lo-ni gire onwoŋo otwero gonyo oko, kono rik en mom ojuro baŋ Kaicari.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
